152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 97 0 R
/E (We give all glory and honor to God for enabling us to accomplish the third edition of the Viewpoint Ministries Nigeria Outreach Program in 2024. Our heartfelt thanks go to the President, Solomon Oluwabiyi, the Director in charge of the School Outreach Program Nigeria, Mrs. Tenille Gregory, the Board Members, and all the donors who made this mission possible. May God continue to bless each of you abundantly.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 97 0 R
/T (The outreach took place on June 5th and 6th, 2024, in three local government areas of Kwara State: Ifelodun, Isin, and Irepodun. A total of 1,736 customized books and 400 pens were transported by our volunteers, of which 1,536 books and 394 pens were distributed. The remaining materials included 200 customized books and 6 pens, which are now being distributed to the children who is attending the our Children Bible Outreach in Nigeria.)
/E (The outreach took place on June 5th and 6th, 2024, in three local government areas of Kwara State: Ifelodun, Isin, and Irepodun. A total of 1,736 customized books and 400 pens were transported by our volunteers, of which 1,536 books and 394 pens were distributed. The remaining materials included 200 customized books and 6 pens, which are now being distributed to the children who is attending the our Children Bible Outreach in Nigeria.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
