/Title (The outreach took place on June 5th and 6th, 2024, in three local government areas of Kwara State: Ifelodun, Isin, and Irepodun. A total of 1,736 customized books and 400 pens were transported by our volunteers, of which 1,536 books and 394 pens were distributed. The remaining materials included 200 customized books and 6 pens, which are now being distributed to the children who is attending the our Children Bible Outreach in Nigeria.)
